"tos_update_14_acceptance_footer" = "By tapping \"Agree and Continue\", you agree to our updated [Terms of Service](https://www.snap.com/terms) and [Paid Features Terms](https://snap.com/terms/paid-features), and acknowledge that you have read the updated [Privacy Policy](https://values.snap.com/privacy/privacy-policy). Beginning February 26, 2024, you will no longer be able to use Snapchat unless you agree to these updated terms.";
