"tos_update_14_india_blurb" = "All Snapchatters must abide by our Terms of Service, including our [Community Guidelines](https://values.snap.com/privacy/transparency/community-guidelines). You may not use Snapchat for illegal purposes, which, in India, includes not using Snapchat to send or post content that violates the Indian IT Rules 2021.\n\n";
"tos_update_14_privacy_content" = " • Added summaries to each section of the Policy to make them easier to understand.\n • More detail on how you can control your information, including downloading your data, who you share content with, and who can contact you.\n • More transparency on how we collect and use your information and content, with examples of what data we use for purposes like personalization, advertising, and building machine learning models.";
